OL,3,GNEWSAHealth Secretary pressed on paused
OL,4,Amaternity unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP asked the health secretary to
OL,7,Fensure a hospital's partially closed
OL,8,Fmaternity unit was fully rebuilt.
OL,10,FWork had started on a planned
OL,11,Ftwo-storey extension at Kettering
OL,12,FGeneral Hospital earlier this year but
OL,13,Fwas paused.
OL,15,FIt would connect to the existing unit,
OL,16,FRockingham Wing, which was partially
OL,17,Fclosed three years ago after reinforced
OL,18,Fautoclaved aerated concrete (Raac) was
OL,19,Ffound in its roof.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
